{"logId": "01d13e9b-e848-44af-92c8-dd22e55ccaad", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [166, 141, 454, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 141.0], [454.0, 141.0], [454.0, 172.0], [166.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [162, 215, 991, 271], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[162.0, 215.0], [991.0, 215.0], [991.0, 271.0], [162.0, 271.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：对金钱和物质的过度追求会让人产生急功近利、不劳而获等错误的思维和行为，对人的精神、心理等各方面造成不同程度的危害，甚至误入歧途。同时也要建立强烈的财产安全意识和财产风险把控能力。无论什么样的情况下，都不能因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害，这是底线原则。", "block_bbox": [163, 298, 1014, 415], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 298.0], [1014.0, 298.0], [1014.0, 415.0], [163.0, 415.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [164, 458, 300, 480], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 458.0], [299.0, 458.0], [299.0, 479.0], [164.0, 479.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、以赢钱、获利为目的的娱乐或赌博行为", "block_bbox": [182, 498, 521, 520], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 498.0], [521.0, 498.0], [521.0, 520.0], [182.0, 520.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、炒股、投资、理财、放贷、借贷、担保等高利或高风险行为", "block_bbox": [181, 529, 683, 551], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[187.0, 529.0], [682.0, 529.0], [682.0, 550.0], [187.0, 550.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、有超出个人偿还或承受能力的相互借款、贷款、信用卡消费等", "block_bbox": [182, 559, 700, 581], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 559.0], [700.0, 559.0], [700.0, 581.0], [182.0, 581.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、缺乏财产安全意识，被盗、被诈骗等导致财产损失", "block_bbox": [182, 590, 611, 612], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 590.0], [611.0, 590.0], [611.0, 612.0], [182.0, 612.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、套用信用卡为自己或他人获利", "block_bbox": [183, 621, 450, 643], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 621.0], [450.0, 621.0], [450.0, 643.0], [183.0, 643.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、提供个人身份证给他人使用，被套用征信用于贷款、担保、抵押等", "block_bbox": [182, 651, 736, 674], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[182.0, 651.0], [736.0, 651.0], [736.0, 674.0], [182.0, 674.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[76]", "block_bbox": [574, 718, 611, 737], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 718.0], [610.0, 718.0], [610.0, 736.0], [574.0, 736.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 491, 931], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [491.0, 900.0], [491.0, 931.0], [201.0, 931.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、因房贷、车贷造成经济压力（月供总金额占个人或家庭收入30%以上）", "block_bbox": [219, 976, 800, 999], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 976.0], [800.0, 976.0], [800.0, 999.0], [219.0, 999.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、拜谒神佛，佩戴夸张的饰品护身，祈求大吉大利、转运心态、暴富心态", "block_bbox": [220, 1007, 810, 1030], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1007.0], [810.0, 1007.0], [810.0, 1030.0], [220.0, 1030.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、日常节日等相互祝福使用“恭喜发财”“钱途无限”“财源广进”“财源滚滚”等功利性语言", "block_bbox": [220, 1038, 988, 1061], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1038.0], [988.0, 1038.0], [988.0, 1061.0], [220.0, 1061.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、同事之间相互随礼（以部门形式统一安排）", "block_bbox": [220, 1068, 594, 1092], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1068.0], [594.0, 1068.0], [594.0, 1092.0], [220.0, 1092.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "11、下级私自请上级吃饭", "block_bbox": [221, 1100, 427, 1121], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[221.0, 1100.0], [426.0, 1100.0], [426.0, 1120.0], [221.0, 1120.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "12、工作中急于销售、追求功利的服务状态，故意激发顾客的购买欲望或言语上给顾客形成选购紧迫感", "block_bbox": [220, 1130, 1035, 1153], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[220.0, 1130.0], [1035.0, 1130.0], [1035.0, 1153.0], [220.0, 1153.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[77]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 649, 1498], "block_id": 18, "block_order": null, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8064170479774475, "coordinate": [166, 141, 454, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 141.0], [454.0, 141.0], [454.0, 172.0], [166.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7844632267951965, "coordinate": [162, 215, 991, 271], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[162.0, 215.0], [991.0, 215.0], [991.0, 271.0], [162.0, 271.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9402333498001099, "coordinate": [163, 298, 1014, 415], "order": 3, "polygo